abstract: >-
  Two-timescale threshold flips (TTF): training ternary ({-1, 0, 1}) language models without full-precision master
  weights, and converting pretrained models to ternary weights with the same update.
keywords:
  - ternary neural networks
  - low-bit training
  - large language models
